{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>Whatever touches the altar shall become holy.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: I might think, whether fit or unfit; Scripture says, ״וזה אשר תעשה על המזבח כבשים בני שנה״ — just as lambs in their first year are fit, so all must be fit. Another interpretation: כל הנוגע במזבח — every priest who comes to offer a sacrifice must first sanctify himself; once he has gone up, he does not come back down."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:05:22.540281101Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}